url: "https://github.com/SichenTao/RDE26"
abstract: >-
  Source code of RDE26, the differential evolution solvers that ranked first in all
  four tracks (bound-constrained and constrained single-objective, bound-constrained
  and constrained multi-objective) of the IEEE WCCI 2026 / IEEE CEC 2026 Competition
  on Numerical Optimization Considering Accuracy and Speed.
keywords:
  - differential evolution
  - numerical optimization
  - evolutionary algorithm
  - IEEE CEC 2026
